event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":89,"item_id":"rs_0ea616322b1d82c4016aca9019eea487d2acdcea7590fe5b89","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Implementing server-rendered forms**\n\nI'm looking to create simple server-rendered forms that don't require JavaScript to function, focusing on valid stack using HTML and CSS, with JavaScript being optional. The plan includes implementing a POST redirect to handle blank submissions, raising a 422 error for validation issues. I need to set up endpoints like /projects for creation details, use built-in Node testing, and design a default SQLite database for project data while ensuring proper escaping."}

